{
  "hash": 19542588,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "While within 15 meters of an ally:\nGrants a stack of Nano-Munitions every 3 seconds. Maximum of 7 stacks.\n\nEmptying this weapon's magazine consumes a stack to <title refill [G_refill] /> 25% of your magazine (rounded up). Consuming a stack restarts the timer for gaining new stacks.\n\nEmptying the magazine of any other weapon consumes all stacks, with each stack refilling 25% of your Magazine (rounded up). Holding a weapon with an empty magazine also consumes these stacks.\n\nHeat weapons confuse the perk in unexpected and inconsistent ways, and all stacks may be consumed at random while using one.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-20T21:44:39.275Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
